    "tagline": "Comeback Story • The Chosen One",
    "synopsis": "Ten years ago, Austin—the galaxy's greatest hero—crushed the Star-Eater invasion and vanished. He hung up his mech, the \"Starshatter,\" and traded the cockpit for a tractor, a cornfield, and a Labrador named Bingo. Ten years later, the Star-Eaters returned. Earth was losing. When an alien gunship locked its sights on Bingo, Austin snapped. He's going back—into space, into the heart of the enemy, to finish what he started. The universe will kneel. He'll say no. ",
